{
  "sn22.3:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.3 ",
  "sn22.3:0.2": "1. Nakulapituvagga ",
  "sn22.3:0.3": "Hāliddikānisutta ",
  "sn22.3:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn22.3:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ āyasmā mahākaccāno avantīsu viharati kuraraghare papāte pabbate. ",
  "sn22.3:1.3": "Atha kho hāliddikāni gahapati yenāyasmā mahākaccāno tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ mahākaccānaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho hāliddikāni gahapati āyasmantaṁ mahākaccānaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.3:1.4": "“vuttamidaṁ, bhante, bhagavatā aṭṭhakavaggiye māgaṇḍiyapañhe: ",
  "sn22.3:2.1": "‘Okaṁ pahāya aniketasārī, ",
  "sn22.3:2.2": "Gāme akubbaṁ muni santhavāni; ",
  "sn22.3:2.3": "Kāmehi ritto apurakkharāno, ",
  "sn22.3:2.4": "Kathaṁ na viggayha janena kayirā’ti. ",
  "sn22.3:3.1": "Imassa nu kho, bhante, bhagavatā saṅkhittena bhāsitassa kathaṁ vitthārena attho daṭṭhabbo”ti? ",
  "sn22.3:4.1": "“Rūpadhātu kho, gahapati, viññāṇassa oko. ",
  "sn22.3:4.2": "Rūpadhāturāgavinibandhañca pana viññāṇaṁ ‘okasārī’ti vuccati. ",
  "sn22.3:4.3": "Vedanādhātu kho, gahapati, viññāṇassa oko. ",
  "sn22.3:4.4": "Vedanādhāturāgavinibandhañca pana viññāṇaṁ ‘okasārī’ti vuccati. ",
  "sn22.3:4.5": "Saññādhātu kho, gahapati, viññāṇassa oko. ",
  "sn22.3:4.6": "Saññādhāturāgavinibandhañca pana viññāṇaṁ ‘okasārī’ti vuccati. ",
  "sn22.3:4.7": "Saṅkhāradhātu kho, 